// Programs at the same relative path from different directories, built at once: all.ctx
// starts a `ctxc run .` in each of the four directories before it waits for any. Each program
// is named `p`, and prints its own number; each is built in a directory of its own.
//# build all: spawn/all.ctx
// ctxc's directories for them, which only `ctxc` commands of the case itself are cleared of.
//# remove {work:a/p}
//# remove {work:b/p}
//# remove {work:c/p}
//# remove {work:d/p}
//# $ {all} {ctxc} a/p b/p c/p d/p
//# env: CTX_HOME={home}
//# stack: 209715200
//# stdout:
//| a/p: exit 0, wrote 0
//| b/p: exit 0, wrote 1
//| c/p: exit 0, wrote 2
//| d/p: exit 0, wrote 3
// Four directories, each ctxc's own for one of them: `{work:PATH}` is `p` and a hash of the
// program's path, as ctxc names it.
//# exists {work:a/p}/build
//# exists {work:b/p}/build
//# exists {work:c/p}/build
//# exists {work:d/p}/build
//# remove {work:a/p}
//# remove {work:b/p}
//# remove {work:c/p}
//# remove {work:d/p}
